    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "A couple of small things.\n\nThis calls `re` for every character in the tokenizer loop. The tokenizer is the hot path: `ch.isspace()` does the same without a regex per character.\n\nCould you add a test for `scan_unicode`?\n\n`scan_unicode` is public, so it needs a docstring.",
